# Context Capsule — environment template (Document 18 §3)
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in per-environment values. This file contains names,
# comments, and harmless placeholders ONLY. Never commit a real value here.
#
# Only set the variables required by the feature slice you are enabling. The 1A Core
# Transfer MVP is local-first and requires nothing beyond VITE_APP_ENV.

# --- 1A Core Transfer (required once an app workspace exists) ---------------------
# One of: local | staging | production. Not a secret.
VITE_APP_ENV=local

# --- 1B Optional sync dashboard (leave unset for 1A) ------------------------------
# Public Supabase endpoint for the selected environment.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# Public anon key. Row-level security remains mandatory regardless of this key.
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Server/function only. MUST NOT reach any browser bundle.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- 1C Optional smart draft (leave unset for 1A/1B) ------------------------------
# Server/function only. Never place in an extension build, dashboard build, commit,
# capsule, or export.
# SMART_DRAFT_PROVIDER_API_KEY=

# --- Optional diagnostics (only after consent design is approved) -----------------
# Must point at a non-content endpoint. No capsule text or provider DOM is ever sent.
# VITE_DIAGNOSTICS_ENDPOINT=
